    {
      "id": "698e8bbe0000000000f2007b",
      "text": "[https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKkWOWE_apZaz3bscKXfLhkH5u950LiSjvLnVoj3Db-tAw7qizE=s96-c#.png]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770949566,
      "updated": 1770949566
    },
    {
      "id": "698e8bc00000000000f2008a",
      "text": " [ナンタラさんが公開されているフリーアイコン]を使用しています",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770949569,
      "updated": 1770950253
    },
    {
      "id": "698e8e5c0000000000d94464",
      "text": "　　[ナンタラ]さんのイラストが好き[vlzs.icon]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770950236,
      "updated": 1775460931
    },
    {
      "id": "698ef94300000000001985de",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770977604,
      "updated": 1770977604
    },
    {
      "id": "698e8bc00000000000f2008b",
      "text": "こんにちは！よろしくお願いします",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770949569,
      "updated": 1770949583
    },
    {
      "id": "698e8be50000000000f2008d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770949605,
      "updated": 1770949605
    },
    {
      "id": "6a90da9a0000000000557605",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787878051,
      "updated": 1787878051
    },
    {
      "id": "6a90da6d0000000000557603",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787877998,
      "updated": 1787877998
    },
    {
      "id": "698e8bd30000000000f2008c",
      "text": "参加しているプロジェクト",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770949588,
      "updated": 1770949605
    },
    {
      "id": "698e8db00000000000d9445c",
      "text": "　自分用の非公開プロジェクトは[/ork]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770950064,
      "updated": 1770985317
    },
    {
      "id": "698f16e600000000006cf210",
      "text": "　自分用の公開プロジェクトは[/1685]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770985189,
      "updated": 1770985313
    },
    {
      "id": "698f16e600000000006cf211",
      "text": "　音のメモ帳は[/soundExplore]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770985189,
      "updated": 1770985311
    },
    {
      "id": "698f16e600000000006cf212",
      "text": "　DAWのフォーラムとして使ってもらいたくて作ったが動いていないのは[/spuf]([- [/s1wiki]])",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770985189,
      "updated": 1787878760
    },
    {
      "id": "698f173500000000006cf221",
      "text": "　[/dtmclub]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770985268,
      "updated": 1787878692
    },
    {
      "id": "698f16f000000000006cf213",
      "text": "　[/scrapboxlab]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770985200,
      "updated": 1770985341
    },
    {
      "id": "698f178f00000000006cf223",
      "text": "　[/customize]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770985359,
      "updated": 1770985361
    },
    {
      "id": "6a90dd160000000000557618",
      "text": " ✄ [参加中のプロジェクトを活用事例集にまとめているので、memberページではそれをinfoboxに紹介してもらう]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787878679,
      "updated": 1787878679
    },
    {
      "id": "6a90dd160000000000557619",
      "text": "　✄[AviUtl2のCosense共同プロジェクトを作成したが、削除した]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787878679,
      "updated": 1787878679
    },
    {
      "id": "698e8bbe0000000000f2007c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770949566,
      "updated": 1787831461
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9017ad00000000004c7659",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787828141,
      "updated": 1787829337
    },
    {
      "id": "698e8bbe0000000000f20088",
      "text": "#member",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770949566,
      "updated": 1770949566
    },
    {
      "id": "698e8bbe0000000000f20089",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1770949566,
      "updated": 1770949566
    },
    {
      "id": "698e8f07000000000091fec7",
      "text": "[[歓迎.icon]] いらっしゃい！ようこそ！ [suto3.icon][yosider.icon][Hiro Aki.icon][caki.icon][koyoshi.icon][はるひ.icon][nomadoor.icon][hoagecko.icon][W7kA9pX2.icon][meganii.icon][who.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1770950408,
      "updated": 1771049580
    },
    {
      "id": "698fe62600000000007ca2fe",
      "text": " こんにちは！お邪魔します！[vlzs.icon]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1771038246,
      "updated": 1771038260
    },
    {
      "id": "698e8f09000000000091fec8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1770950409,
      "updated": 1770950409
    },
    {
      "id": "698fdc3c0000000000f5dfac",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1771035708,
      "updated": 1776585756
    },
    {
      "id": "69dcf6e70000000000c8ca36",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1776088808,
      "updated": 1776088808
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbe7",
      "text": "ここはvlzsのページです[Cosense Beaver.icon]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbe8",
      "text": " 自己紹介などを書きましょう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbe9",
      "text": " 反応性が低い",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbea",
      "text": "  「へ～！」と思って読むがそこから何かを思うというのができない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbeb",
      "text": "  たくさん読んではいるがわかってないことが多い",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbec",
      "text": "  もっとたくさん聞けるようになりたい？",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbed",
      "text": "   リアルタイムの会話では、会話の中で返事を遅延すると相手からもっとたくさんの話が聞けることがあるけれど、Cosenseではこの方法が使えない。使えないというか、非ターン制なので言いたいことを全て書くことができ、すでに書かれてる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbee",
      "text": "  反応性を高くしたい",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbef",
      "text": " 性別",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbf0",
      "text": "  手に取っている話題や、返事の仕方、所属集団の性別の比率、文章の雰囲気などから思い浮かぶ方の性別",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbf1",
      "text": "  広場の安全や、自身の安全を作るための、性別をわからなくするミスリーディングな情報開示は少なめ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a90d97e0000000000c4798e",
      "text": "   最近の自分の興味関心と見かける他者の振る舞いから連想して、自損のために書いてみたけれど、他の人を牽制する構図になっているように感じる。少し置いてまだ具合が悪かったら消そう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787877759,
      "updated": 1787877980
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbf2",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbf3",
      "text": "自分が思うことを書くと閉じてる感じであまり楽しくないかも",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832936
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbf4",
      "text": "井戸端上のやり取りの中で新しく見つけた特性を並べたら楽しいかも。",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbf5",
      "text": " 集めた情報からモンタージュを作成するみたいにして、犯人の人物像を特定する",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787833264
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a730000000000bccbfa",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832948,
      "updated": 1787832948
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902b660000000000a6425f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787833190,
      "updated": 1787833190
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a730000000000bccbfb",
      "text": "自分の感覚のストリーミングに敏感みたい",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832948,
      "updated": 1787833158
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902b430000000000a6425c",
      "text": " 作業に集中しているときの体の変化や",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787833156,
      "updated": 1787833182
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a7c0000000000bccbfc",
      "text": "  from [座って作業をしてたらドキドキしてきた]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832956,
      "updated": 1787833159
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902b1f0000000000a6425a",
      "text": " 薬物によく反応してる事に気づいている",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787833120,
      "updated": 1787833162
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902b0b0000000000a64259",
      "text": "  from [2026/08/13#6a7dca4b0000000000575a87]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787833100,
      "updated": 1787833121
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902b260000000000a6425b",
      "text": " これを合わせると自分の感覚をよく見ていると言えそう？",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787833127,
      "updated": 1787833186
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902b620000000000a6425d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787833186,
      "updated": 1787833187
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902b620000000000a6425e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787833187,
      "updated": 1787833187
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbf6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5b0000000000bccbf7",
      "text": "「自己紹介は書かない、振る舞いから人物像を読み取ってくれよな」みたいなのを以前は好んでたっぽい",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832924,
      "updated": 1787832924
    },
    {
      "id": "6a902a5e0000000000bccbf8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787832926,
      "updated": 1787832926
    },
    {
      "id": "69dcf6e80000000000c8ca37",
      "text": "[更新行をスクロールバーに表示、を非表示にする]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1776088809,
      "updated": 1776088809
    },
    {
      "id": "69dcf6e80000000000c8ca38",
      "text": " code:style.css",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1776088809,
      "updated": 1776088819
    },
    {
      "id": "69dcf6e80000000000c8ca39",
      "text": "  .scroll-bar-overlay {",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1776088809,
      "updated": 1776088813
    },
    {
      "id": "69dcf6e80000000000c8ca3a",
      "text": "      display: none;",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1776088809,
      "updated": 1776088813
    },
    {
      "id": "69dcf6e80000000000c8ca3b",
      "text": "  }",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1776088809,
      "updated": 1776088813
    },
    {
      "id": "698fdc3e0000000000f5dfad",
      "text": "スマホから見れないようにする",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1771035711,
      "updated": 1780751106
    },
    {
      "id": "6a241afd0000000000bf7637",
      "text": " code:style.css",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1780751102,
      "updated": 1780751102
    },
    {
